[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=DelayOS Windows game list
Name[ko]=DelayOS Windows 게임 목록
Comment=Show Windows games in the Start menu when a Windows install is present
Comment[ko]=Windows가 설치되어 있으면 Windows 게임을 시작 메뉴에 표시합니다
Exec=delay-winboot --session-start
Icon=delayos-winboot-game
Terminal=false
NoDisplay=true
StartupNotify=false
X-KDE-autostart-phase=2
